# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in the value. That copy is yours and
# is not committed; this template is what the repository carries.
#
# Only the shared secret lives here. Everything else this Worker reads is in
# `wrangler.toml`, so no name appears in both files and nothing overrides
# anything.

# The same string as INGEST_SHARED_SECRET in the repo-root `.env`, and the same
# one `wrangler secret put INGEST_SHARED_SECRET --env production` sets on the
# deployed Worker. The server signs upload tickets with it and this Worker
# verifies them, so a mismatch rejects every upload with 401.
# Generate one with `openssl rand -hex 32`.
INGEST_SHARED_SECRET=
